    and v12.16b, v7.16b, v17.16b
    cmeq v12.16b, v12.16b, v18.16b
    cmeq v13.16b, v4.16b, v19.16b
    and v12.16b, v12.16b, v13.16b
    and v13.16b, v8.16b, v20.16b
    cmeq v13.16b, v13.16b, v21.16b
    and v9.16b, v9.16b, v5.16b
    cmeq v9.16b, v9.16b, v5.16b
    and v13.16b, v13.16b, v9.16b
    orr v13.16b, v13.16b, v10.16b
    and v12.16b, v12.16b, v13.16b
